00:31:37.923 --> 00:31:39.100
Huwag kang susuko.

466
00:31:42.573 --> 00:31:44.063
tutulungan kita.

467
00:31:53.076 --> 00:31:54.469
Guro, pakiusap...

468
00:31:54.470 --> 00:31:55.593
Guro.

469
00:31:59.583 --> 00:32:01.790
guro...

470
00:32:02.610 --> 00:32:03.713
Guro.

471
00:32:27.095 --> 00:32:29.097
(Sa Surgery)

472
00:33:15.010 --> 00:33:16.459
Maraming beses na akong naghiwa ng mansanas sa bahay, okay?

473
00:33:16.460 --> 00:33:18.826
Oh, Hee-won.

474
00:33:20.886 --> 00:33:22.120
Ji-woo.

475
00:33:29.663 --> 00:33:31.323
So ikaw si Ji-woo.

476
00:33:31.840 --> 00:33:32.706
ano?

477
00:33:33.290 --> 00:33:34.406
Dumating ka sa tamang oras.

478
00:33:34.820 --> 00:33:37.559
Guro, okay ba ang iyong katawan?

479
00:33:37.560 --> 00:33:38.580
Ako?

480
00:33:38.990 --> 00:33:41.259
Gaya ng nakikita mo, ayos lang ako.

481
00:33:41.260 --> 00:33:43.099
Sabi ng doktor napakaswerte mo.

482
00:33:43.100 --> 00:33:44.610
Kailangan mo lang ma-ospital sa loob ng dalawang linggo.

483
00:33:47.846 --> 00:33:49.356
Teacher, sorry talaga.

484
00:33:49.810 --> 00:33:53.099
Talagang babayaran ko ang baliw na iyon na si Lee Hyun-woo.

485
00:33:53.100 --> 00:33:54.183
At ang mga medikal na bayarin...

486
00:33:54.860 --> 00:33:57.219
Bigyan mo lang ako ng oras, kahit papaano ay...

487
00:33:57.220 --> 00:33:58.610
Sumali ka na rin diba?

488
00:33:59.620 --> 00:34:00.579
ano?

489
00:34:00.580 --> 00:34:01.739
Well...

490
00:34:01.740 --> 00:34:04.960
Nagpasya din si Hee-won na sumali sa study group.

491
00:34:06.780 --> 00:34:08.049
Ang study group?

492
00:34:08.050 --> 00:34:11.689
Oo lumipat ako pero wala akong balak lumipat ng school.

493
00:34:11.690 --> 00:34:14.479
Sinuri ko, at isang oras at kalahati lang sa bus.

494
00:34:14.480 --> 00:34:16.529
Kaya dapat nakakapag-commute ako papuntang school.

495
00:34:16.530 --> 00:34:19.276
Gusto kong manatili dito at mag-aral nang magkasama.

496
00:34:20.486 --> 00:34:22.643
Ji-woo, sasali ka rin ha?

497
00:34:23.720 --> 00:34:24.790
Sabay tayong mag-aral.

498
00:34:25.556 --> 00:34:26.396
Oo.

499
00:34:31.013 --> 00:34:31.720
Okay.

500
00:34:35.406 --> 00:34:37.850
Um... pasensya na talaga.

501
00:34:42.536 --> 00:34:43.373
Pero ako...

502
00:34:45.963 --> 00:34:48.230
gustong sumali sa study group.

503
00:34:57.020 --> 00:34:57.996
Ang galing!

504
00:35:02.584 --> 00:35:04.969
(Meteor Senior Vocational High School)

505
00:35:04.970 --> 00:35:07.353
Dito kami nag-aaral ngayon.

506
00:35:13.463 --> 00:35:14.550
Anong ginagawa niya?

507
00:35:20.568 --> 00:35:21.456
(Ang mga Miyembro ng Meteor Vocational High School Study Group ay Tiyak na Makakakuha ng Matataas na Marka sa CSAT!)

508
00:35:21.457 --> 00:35:22.940
Anong ginagawa niya?

509
00:35:23.580 --> 00:35:24.813
Hindi naman siguro siya masyadong magaling mag-aral diba?

510
00:35:25.610 --> 00:35:27.903
Naghanda ka talaga ng ganito.

511
00:35:28.863 --> 00:35:30.133
Kahanga-hanga iyon.

512
00:35:30.840 --> 00:35:32.129
Maliit na bagay lang.

513
00:35:32.130 --> 00:35:34.549
Dahil ako ang study group leader, syempre kailangan ko itong paghandaan.

514
00:35:34.550 --> 00:35:36.506
Naririnig lang ba niya ang gusto niyang marinig?

515
00:35:36.866 --> 00:35:39.223
Oo, pag-iisip tungkol dito nang mabuti, tila gayon.

516
00:35:41.326 --> 00:35:42.420
Sobrang kinakabahan ako.

517
00:35:43.320 --> 00:35:44.430
Ano bang problema mo ngayon?

518
00:35:45.894 --> 00:35:46.680
(Papayo sa Guro na si Lee Han-kyung)

519
00:35:46.681 --> 00:35:48.740
Dahil napagtanto kong mapupuno din ang lugar na ito.

520
00:35:49.320 --> 00:35:51.112
Tama, kinakabahan din ako.

521
00:35:51.113 --> 00:35:51.960
Seryoso...

522
00:35:52.376 --> 00:35:53.893
- Magsaya ka! - Magsaya ka!

523
00:35:55.260 --> 00:35:57.656
- Binili mo rin ba ito? - Oo.

524
00:36:00.510 --> 00:36:02.333
Kailan mo kinuha ang mga larawang iyon?

525
00:36:03.430 --> 00:36:04.190
Cute diba?

526
00:36:04.191 --> 00:36:05.509
Pero...

527
00:36:05.510 --> 00:36:07.099
Narinig niyo na ba guys?

528
00:36:07.100 --> 00:36:08.876
Si Pi Han-wool ay inaresto rin ng mga pulis.

529
00:36:12.063 --> 00:36:13.010
Hey.

530
00:36:13.600 --> 00:36:14.920
Ikaw si Pi Han-wool, tama ba?

531
00:36:15.870 --> 00:36:17.529
Mag-usap tayo.

532
00:36:17.530 --> 00:36:19.770
- Ako... - Detective Na Tae-man, tama ba?

533
00:36:21.170 --> 00:36:22.293
Tara na.

534
00:36:25.133 --> 00:36:27.099
Pinag-uusapan ito ng lahat.

535
00:36:27.100 --> 00:36:29.050
Bakit inaresto si Pi Han-wool?

536
00:36:29.640 --> 00:36:31.059
Matapos imbestigahan si Lee Hyun-woo,

537
00:36:31.060 --> 00:36:33.069
kung inaresto agad si Pi Han-wool,

538
00:36:33.070 --> 00:36:35.613
pupunta siya sa juvie tulad ni Lee Hyun-woo...

539
00:36:41.593 --> 00:36:42.460
Hey.

540
00:36:42.461 --> 00:36:43.519
Syempre kailangan niyang pumunta.

541
00:36:43.520 --> 00:36:45.046
Yung mga brats.

542
00:36:45.950 --> 00:36:47.599
Ngunit ang lalaking iyon na si Pi Han-wool,

543
00:36:47.600 --> 00:36:49.186
dumating din sa school ngayon.

544
00:36:59.317 --> 00:37:00.260
Ano ang?

545
00:37:00.260 --> 00:37:01.226
Anong nangyayari?

546
00:37:06.006 --> 00:37:07.416
Yoon Jiamin.

547
00:37:07.900 --> 00:37:09.636
Bumaba ka na agad.

548
00:37:13.520 --> 00:37:14.379
Bakit?

549
00:37:14.380 --> 00:37:15.290
Seryoso ka ba nagtatanong kung bakit?

550
00:37:15.880 --> 00:37:17.359
"Bakit?" F***.

551
00:37:17.360 --> 00:37:18.559
Nagtatanong talaga siya kung bakit. Ano ang dapat kong gawin sa kanya?

552
00:37:18.560 --> 00:37:21.123
Damn, alam kong mangyayari ito.

553
00:37:21.960 --> 00:37:22.850
ano?

554
00:37:23.820 --> 00:37:25.729
Kahit wala kang pakialam,

555
00:37:25.730 --> 00:37:27.859
lahat ng nasa Meteor Vocational High School ay nakatutok sa iyo ngayon.

556
00:37:27.860 --> 00:37:28.910
Yoon Jiamin.

557
00:37:32.930 --> 00:37:34.203
(Meteor Vocational High School Student Council) Kyu-jin, anong nangyari sayo?

558
00:37:34.780 --> 00:37:37.189
okay ka lang ba? Sino ang gumawa nito sa iyo?

559
00:37:37.190 --> 00:37:38.789
Si Yoon Jiamin na naman ba?

560
00:37:38.790 --> 00:37:41.343
Yung lalaking Yoon Jiamin talaga...

561
00:37:42.190 --> 00:37:43.000
Hey.

562
00:37:43.001 --> 00:37:44.629
I heard Yoon Jiamin also beat the crap out of Kim Kyu-jin this time.

563
00:37:44.630 --> 00:37:45.433
talaga?

564
00:37:45.434 --> 00:37:46.849
Kim Kyu-jin?

565
00:37:46.850 --> 00:37:49.119
Ang miyembro ng student council na may background sa judo?

566
00:37:49.120 --> 00:37:51.289
Hay, pero second year na si Kim Kyu-jin?

567
00:37:51.290 --> 00:37:54.103
Tumalon lang ang demonyong iyon sa ikalawang taon.

568
00:37:55.690 --> 00:37:57.690
Kung gayon ano ang mangyayari kay Kang Tae-oh?

569
00:37:59.680 --> 00:38:00.909
Ano ang pinag-uusapan ng mga lalaking iyon?

570
00:38:00.910 --> 00:38:03.259
Gaano man kagulo ang Meteor Vocational High School,

571
00:38:03.260 --> 00:38:06.219
mayroong hindi binibigkas na panuntunan laban sa pakikipagkumpitensya para sa mga ranggo sa pagitan ng mga grado.

572
00:38:06.220 --> 00:38:08.089
Pero nilabag mo ang unspoken rule na iyon.

573
00:38:08.090 --> 00:38:08.880
Mukhang takot na takot siya.

574
00:38:08.881 --> 00:38:11.099
Takot na takot siyang gumawa ng kahit ano ngayon, di ba?

575
00:38:11.100 --> 00:38:12.016
Kaya tanong ko,

576
00:38:12.713 --> 00:38:13.886
sino siya?

577
00:38:18.303 --> 00:38:19.389
(1st Year Rank 1: Kang Tae-oh) Kang Tae-oh.

578
00:38:19.390 --> 00:38:20.780
1st Year Rank 1.

579
00:38:21.956 --> 00:38:24.119
F***, sabi ko bumaba ka!

580
00:38:24.120 --> 00:38:26.299
Let's decide kung sino ang tunay na boss!

581
00:38:26.300 --> 00:38:27.496
Halika na!

582
00:38:28.420 --> 00:38:29.833
Pwede ka na lang maging boss.

583
00:38:31.616 --> 00:38:32.879
Hoy, nakita niyo ba yun?

584
00:38:32.880 --> 00:38:34.536
Tumatakbo ang batang iyon habang ang buntot sa pagitan ng kanyang mga paa!

585
00:38:36.983 --> 00:38:37.790
ano?

586
00:38:38.580 --> 00:38:39.809
Siya ba ay...

587
00:38:39.810 --> 00:38:41.323
mababa ang tingin sa akin?

588
00:38:41.690 --> 00:38:42.889
Oo, eksakto!

589
00:38:42.890 --> 00:38:44.132
Tae-oh, mababa ang tingin niya sayo!

590
00:38:44.133 --> 00:38:45.469
Hindi lang mababa ang tingin sayo, hinahamak ka pa niya!

591
00:38:45.470 --> 00:38:47.249
Hindi lang hinahamak ka, tinatrato ka niya na parang wala ka!

592
00:38:47.250 --> 00:38:48.863
Pagtrato sa akin na parang wala ako...

593
00:38:49.890 --> 00:38:51.850
Hoy, punk ka!

594
00:38:53.650 --> 00:38:54.799
How dare you look down on me!

595
00:38:54.800 --> 00:38:56.869
Yoon Jiamin, hindi ka ba bababa?

596
00:38:56.870 --> 00:38:58.396
Saan nagpunta si Joon?

597
00:38:58.886 --> 00:39:01.150
Bitawan mo ako, basura ka!

598
00:39:02.530 --> 00:39:04.906
Ikaw punk, nandito ka.

599
00:39:05.410 --> 00:39:06.636
Ano ito ngayon?

600
00:39:07.328 --> 00:39:10.469
Tumigil ka sa paggalaw, punk!

601
00:39:10.470 --> 00:39:14.199
Ang batang ito ay kumikilos nang mayabang na nagsasabing sasakupin niya ang Meteor Vocational High School.

602
00:39:14.200 --> 00:39:17.089
Akala ko may espiritu siya.

603
00:39:17.090 --> 00:39:19.909
May hawak pala siyang nakakadiri.

604
00:39:19.910 --> 00:39:20.571
(Study Group Member Application Form) Ano ito?

605
00:39:20.572 --> 00:39:21.253
(Mechanics Dept. 1st Year, No. 27 Lee Joon) (Plano ng Aktibidad sa Hinaharap: Conquer Meteor Vocational High School)

606
00:39:21.254 --> 00:39:23.239
Study group membership application form!

607
00:39:23.240 --> 00:39:24.643
Grupo ng pag-aaral?

608
00:39:25.563 --> 00:39:26.460
mababaliw na ako.

609
00:39:27.120 --> 00:39:29.255
Yoon Jiamin, kasalanan mo ang lahat sa pagtatanim ng mga kakaibang ideya sa kanyang ulo!

610
00:39:29.256 --> 00:39:31.973
Ginawa mo siyang tulala!

611
00:39:32.490 --> 00:39:33.623
Ibigay mo yan.

612
00:39:34.470 --> 00:39:35.200
Ito?

613
00:39:37.640 --> 00:39:38.810
Punk ka.

614
00:39:45.573 --> 00:39:47.669
Cute na maliit na lalaki.

615
00:39:47.670 --> 00:39:51.169
Mula ngayon, ang sinumang may hawak nitong papel ay mamamatay sa aking mga kamay.

616
00:39:51.170 --> 00:39:52.166
Naintindihan mo?

617
00:39:57.466 --> 00:39:58.430
Anong ginagawa niya?

618
00:40:08.576 --> 00:40:09.676
Yoon Jiamin.

619
00:40:15.990 --> 00:40:18.013
F***.

620
00:40:57.939 --> 00:41:01.976
"Pangkat ng Pag-aaral"

